phase 4
The Blueprint for Phase 4 (Order & Checkout Engine)
To build out this phase cleanly, we will tackle it in three focused steps:

Step 1: The Cart & Validation Endpoint (POST /cart/validate)

Takes a list of items (product IDs and quantities).

Queries Postgres/Redis to verify live prices, active sales, and stock availability.

Calculates subtotal, service fees, and grand total.

Step 2: The Checkout & Concurrency Engine (POST /checkout/process)

Implements database transactions (BEGIN / COMMIT / ROLLBACK).

Handles atomic stock decrement (ensuring no negative inventory).

Simulates or integrates the payment gateway callback.

Step 3: Post-Payment Pipeline & Invalidation

Wipes the user's Redis cart.

Invalidates store inventory caches because stock levels just dropped.

Logs the successful order.


